# The Barrens - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# The pack's second HORDE route and its first large heartland zone: every
# Barrens accept in the local census (157 quests, docs/barrens-census.md)
# appears exactly once as an accept and once as a turnin. Band 10-25 by
# minLevel cluster (zone id 1413, order 35). Ratchet sits on the zone map
# (the Booty Bay precedent) so its accepts are zone content. 17 Alliance
# set-asides, 56 above-band records, 46 repeatable/battleground records and
# the broken/seasonal/out-of-zone rest are out with reasons in the census.
# 1144 Willix the Importer is OUT: its giver has no placed spawn anywhere
# and its objective is the in-instance Razorfen Kraul escape.
# No race header: Tauren, Orc, Troll and Undead all play this route, with
# per-line gates where the data is exclusive - only Tauren on 854/6361/
# 6362, only Orc,Troll on 6365/6384, only Druid,Tauren on 6128. Class
# gates ride the data: only Warrior on the Thun'grim/Ruga line, only
# Rogue on 2381/2478, only Shaman on the Telf/Islen/Brine lines, only
# Druid on 6128/6129, only Warlock on the Dogran chain and 1740. The
# hunter chain (Sergra/Jorn) carries no class gate in the data, and
# neither does Ak'Zeloth's line - both ship ungated per the data-wins
# rule. One profession quest: 866 Root Samples (skill 182 Herbalism),
# optional and when-skill gated. Soft-pre accepts whose blocking
# pre-quest sits outside the contract carry a note at the accept (860
# Mulgore for 844, 773 Mulgore for 775, 840 Durotar for 842, 809
# Orgrimmar for 924, 1061 Orgrimmar for 1062, 1094 Stonetalon for 1095,
# 1509 Orgrimmar for 1510, 1511 Stonetalon for 1515, 1517 Durotar for
# 1518, 1520 Mulgore for 1521, 1522/1523/2983/2984 Orgrimmar/Durotar/
# Mulgore for 1524, 1528/1529/2985/2986 Orgrimmar/Mulgore for 1530,
# 1823 Orgrimmar for 1824, 2382 Orgrimmar for 2381, 2458 Orgrimmar for
# 2478, 3513 Ashenvale for 3514, 6127 Moonglade for 6128, 6523
# Stonetalon for 6401, 6542 Stonetalon for 6543, 79008 Hillsbrad for
# 79192, 100 Silverpine for 96); their turn-ins stand alone in when
# onquest mini-steps. R2 bag-note records (no source anywhere in the
# data): 6981's Shard (Mutanus unplaced), 91899's crate, 4021's banner,
# 1221's tubers, 1740's fragments, 6543's Warsong updates, 1838's vial
# (Roogug unplaced). R5: 1838's turnin is optional - its Iron Bars are
# crafted and its vial has no placed source. Dungeon work (1487, and
# 1486's Ravagers) rides bare completes at the Wailing Caverns mouth
# with a note - the data places no spawns for those mobs. No loop steps:
# every placed complete rides data-placed coordinates. Expedition
# turn-ins and legs: Thunder Bluff, Orgrimmar, Undercity, Durotar,
# Mulgore, Ashenvale, Stonetalon, Thousand Needles, Hillsbrad,
# Silverpine, Moonglade and Westfall.
guide butler-routes-completionist/the-barrens
title The Barrens - Completionist
levels 10-25
zone The Barrens
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

